@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft JhengHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
title 循序圖：站內通知建立與 FCM 推播派送

participant "業務服務\n(訂單/聊天/檢舉等任一服務)" as Biz
database "notifications" as DB
participant "services/push/dispatcher.js\n（每3秒輪詢）" as Dispatcher
participant "services/push/devices.js" as DeviceSvc
database "push_devices" as DevDB
participant "lib/fcm.js" as FCM
participant "Firebase Cloud Messaging" as FCMCloud
actor 使用者裝置 as Device

Biz -> DB : notifications.insert(type, title, content,\nactor_id, related_id, related_type)
note right: 依使用者偏好決定是否推播：\norder/reservation看notification_order、\nmessage看notification_message、\npromotion看notification_promo、\nsystem不可關閉

loop 每 3 秒輪詢
  Dispatcher -> DB : 查詢 pushed_at 為空\n且距最新通知15分鐘內之通知（每批200筆）
  Dispatcher -> DB : 標記 pushed_at = now（避免重複派送）
  Dispatcher -> DeviceSvc : 取得接收者之推播裝置(最多10台)
  DeviceSvc -> DevDB : 查詢 push_devices
  par 並行20筆
    Dispatcher -> FCM : buildMessage(notification, device, badge)
    FCM -> FCMCloud : FCM HTTP v1 送出（服務帳戶JWT）
    FCMCloud --> Device : 系統推播通知 / data-only訊息
    alt 暫時性失敗(429/5xx/401/網路)
      FCM -> FCM : 依5/20/60/180秒重試，15分鐘後放棄
    else 裝置權杖已失效(UNREGISTERED/NOT_FOUND)
      FCM -> DevDB : 刪除該裝置token
    end
  end
end

Device -> Device : 前景：App內橫幅(4秒)+更新角標，不響鈴\n背景：系統通知（Android data-only繪製,\niOS走通知服務擴充抓頭像組成通訊通知）
Device -> Biz : 點擊通知 → PATCH /api/notifications/:id/read\n並依related_type導向對應畫面
@enduml
